  "Luxembourg's total fuel imports unit value increased from 0.59 euros per kilogram in 2018 to 0.79 euros per kilogram in 2025.",
  "This represents a rise of 34.5% over the period.",
  "The highest unit value was recorded in 2023, reaching 0.93 euros per kilogram.",
  "The unit value trend shows a peak in 2023 before declining to 0.79 euros per kilogram in 2025.",
